Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Cloak of Atonment"
	SAY DESC "Atonement involves making reparations, paying a price. The Cloak of Atonement takes this requirement literally. In exchange for protection and safety, it will leech the health of its wearer to power itself.

