//GARGOYLE CLOAK - 5000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDCLCK05.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Cloak"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The cloak can be made in every possible shape with just about every type of fabric. The most common forms are a circular piece of fabric with a hole in the center for the head, and fabric draped from neck, connected by a chain, brooch, cord, or pins.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Gargoyle Cloak"
	SAY DESC "Woven from heavy, stone-spun threads, this slate-gray cloak imbues its wearer with the legendary resilience of a gargoyle. The elemental magic within its fabric permanently shields vital organs from lethal critical strikes. Furthermore, when the wearer is heavily wounded and facing death, the cloak reacts violently—hardening into an invisible wall of granite that effortlessly deflects incoming blades, clubs, and missiles.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Combat abilities:
- User gets +3 AC vs. Slashing, Piercing and Missile if they drop below 25% HP for 5 rounds

Weight: 3"





//CLOAK OF DEFIANCE - 5000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDCLCK06.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Cloak"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The cloak can be made in every possible shape with just about every type of fabric. The most common forms are a circular piece of fabric with a hole in the center for the head, and fabric draped from neck, connected by a chain, brooch, cord, or pins.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Cloak of Defiance"
	SAY DESC "Woven during the Fall of Netheril by the mage Vaelen, this cloak was designed to survive the cataclysmic duels of rival arcanists.During the Siege of Voron-Dis, the mantle flared with silver light, absorbing a lethal barrage of disintegration beams and saving Vaelen's life. Though the intense feedback permanently burned out most of its original power, the residual magic within the threads remains fiercely stubborn.Once per day, the wearer can force the cloak to recall its ancient form, temporarily reconstructing an absolute barrier that turns devastating spells into harmless sparks.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Set Magic Resistance to 50% once per day
  Duration: 1 turn

Weight: 3"




//MATICK'S SHROUD  - solo maghi e bardi - 6500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CLCK20.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Cloak"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The cloak can be made in every possible shape with just about every type of fabric. The most common forms are a circular piece of fabric with a hole in the center for the head, and fabric draped from neck, connected by a chain, brooch, cord, or pins.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Matick's Shroud"
	SAY DESC "This cloak was crafted by the legendary archmage Matick, the brilliant wizard credited with inventing the ubiquitous Magic Missile spell. During his research into raw Evocation, Matick became terrified that his own deadly creation would be turned against him by jealous rivals.To safeguard his life, he spent decades weaving this shroud to perfectly ground out the specific frequencies of his signature spell. Ironically, the master of offensive magic created the ultimate defensive garment, ensuring no apprentice could ever destroy the teacher with his own creation.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Immunity to Magic Missile
- Saving throws vs. Evocation: +4
- Fire Resistance: +20%
- Cold Resistance: +20%
- Electricity Resistance: +20%
- Magical Damage Resistance: +20%

Weight: 3"




//CLOAK OF THE SEWERS - 4500mo//
