//LIFE SHROUD - 10000mo - solo chierici no evil//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDCLCK03.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Cloak"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The cloak can be made in every possible shape with just about every type of fabric. The most common forms are a circular piece of fabric with a hole in the center for the head, and fabric draped from neck, connected by a chain, brooch, cord, or pins.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Life Shroud"
	SAY DESC "Fashioned by the high clerics of the Morninglord during the catastrophic Siege of Tulanth, this cloak was consecrated for a single purpose: to survive the wrath of the infamous necromancer Abi-Dalzim. As the mage’s horrific wilting spells turned entire armies into dust, the lightbringers channeled their collective divine essence into this garment, creating an absolute shield against arcane necromancy. Infused with pure holy energy, the shroud amplifies its wearer's divine spellcasting and burns undead horrors with radiant fury. Because it is bound to the magic of absolute light, the cloak becomes heavy as lead and entirely useless in the hands of any neutral or evil being.

